# EPISODE 1 — (Untitled)

## COLD OPEN

EXT. CITY INTERSECTION - NIGHT #E01-001#

= Universe B (unrevealed). Mike's second death, seen from a distance: a hook that hides whether the crash was an accident or a choice.

[[Never show Mike inside the car or at the moment of impact. Keep the crash ambiguous (accident vs. choice is an open question). Katie B must NOT appear.]]

A quiet intersection. Wet asphalt reflects the traffic lights.

A sleek, expensive black sedan glides into the intersection.

From the side, headlights. A car slams into it.

Glass bursts. Metal folds. The sedan spins and stops against a light pole.

Silence. A single hubcap rolls across the road and wobbles to a stop.

Distant sirens rise. Red and blue light washes over the wreck as a police cruiser and an ambulance pull in at the edge of frame.

[[Narration is delivered slowly, over the wreck, AFTER the crash and BEFORE the camera rises. Tone: frustrated, yet at peace with death.]]

MIKE (V.O.)
(slow, quiet)
That's me in there.
(long beat)
Last time, I fought it. Every second.
(beat)
This time... I just let go.
(beat)
Not sure if that makes me brave, or the biggest idiot alive.
(beat)
Well. Not alive.
(beat)
This is the second time I've died.
(long beat)
Let me tell you about the people I left behind. Both times.

The CAMERA drifts up, away from the wreck, past the streetlights, into the night sky.

The sky starts to glow, a deep ember blue, as if lit from the inside.

.THE SPIRITUAL DIMENSION #E01-002#

= The spark returns to its soul: the film's mythology, shown before it is ever explained.

[[Visual language TBD in bible/locations/spiritual-dimension.md. Abstract energy, no faces: AI-friendly. Do NOT show where Mike's spark goes next (protects the Universe C twist).]]

A vast living web of light. Countless souls, each a glowing core of blue electricity, all connected by threads of current.

Sparks stream out of every soul and dive down into the dark. Others stream back up and sink into their souls.

One spark races upward through the current, toward its soul.

The spark hits its soul.

BOOM!

> SMASH TO BLACK.

[[Sound bridge: out of the black, a cheerful mobile-game jingle ("Level complete!") leads into Mike at his boring job in Universe A. Next scene: beats TBD by the author.]]
